From: Vladimir Skvortsov <vskvortsov@emcraft.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:50:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] command: add the cmd_arg helpers

The Toradex secure boot module uses cmd_arg1() and cmd_arg2(), which
U-Boot gained after 2022.10. Add them as later releases define them.

Upstream-Status: Backport [U-Boot v2023.01]
Signed-off-by: Vladimir Skvortsov <vskvortsov@emcraft.com>
---
 include/command.h | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/command.h b/include/command.h
--- a/include/command.h
+++ b/include/command.h
@@ -101,6 +101,21 @@ int cmd_auto_complete(const char *const prompt, char *buf, int *np,
  *	   -1 (CMD_RET_USAGE) if 'usage' error is found
  */
 int cmd_process_error(struct cmd_tbl *cmdtp, int err);
+
+static inline const char *cmd_arg0(int argc, char *const argv[])
+{
+	return argc > 0 ? argv[0] : NULL;
+}
+
+static inline const char *cmd_arg1(int argc, char *const argv[])
+{
+	return argc > 1 ? argv[1] : NULL;
+}
+
+static inline const char *cmd_arg2(int argc, char *const argv[])
+{
+	return argc > 2 ? argv[2] : NULL;
+}
 
 /*
  * Monitor Command
-- 
2.34.1
